# Newzgator API

Use [Swagger UI](https://newzgator-api.onrender.com/swagger-ui/index.html#) as the source of truth for the public API at `https://newzgator-api.onrender.com`.

## Bookmarks

- `GET /api/v1/bookmarks` — list saved articles (`cursor`, `limit`)
- `POST /api/v1/bookmarks` — body `{ "articleId": number }`
- `DELETE /api/v1/bookmarks/{articleId}` — remove a saved article

Send `X-User-Id` on client calls. Do not invent paths; check Swagger first.
